      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i tried running it in a separate container but honestly it's still acting weird. sometimes it's a timeout, sometimes it's a random file not found error, sometimes it's a network socket issue. it feels totally non-deterministic. is there a specific way to check if there's some kind of resource contention or maybe a race condition in the build agent itself?",
