      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, i've checked the metrics and nothing looks crazy. CPU and RAM seem fine on the agents. it's just so random... like, it's almost like something is messing with the process intermittently. do you think it could be a hidden background task or some weird leak in the jenkins agent itself that isn't showing up in the standard monitors?",
